      "instance_name": "isis",
      "label": "ISIS (Islamic State of Iraq and Syria)",
      "description": "A violent extremist group that has been responsible for numerous terrorist attacks and atrocities. The meme references ISIS as a real-world entity, using it to create a hateful and degrading analogy. The group is not associated with strip clubs or sexualized behavior, making the meme's comparison a form of hate speech.",
